<h2>Verify your email address</h2>

<p>Hello <%= @user.full_name.presence || @user.email %>,</p>

<p>Thank you for registering. Please verify your email address by clicking the link below:</p>

<p>
  <%= link_to "Verify Email", @verification_link, style: "display: inline-block; padding: 10px 20px; background-color: #1F4E79; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px;" %>
</p>

<p>Or copy and paste this link in your browser:</p>
<p><%= @verification_link %></p>

<p><strong>Note:</strong> This link will expire in 15 minutes.</p>

<p>If you didn't create this account, you can ignore this email.</p>

<p>Best regards,<br/>Rubusoo Team</p>
